# .gitignore — Rust build artifacts
#
# This file covers only the Rust workspace's build outputs. The pre-existing
# assembly build artifacts (`.o` files and `.asm`-built binaries in rwasa/,
# sshtalk/, hnwatch/, toplip/, webslap/, dhtool/, util/) ARE tracked in git
# intentionally (reference builds for benchmark comparison) and therefore
# are not listed here.
#
# `Cargo.lock` is intentionally NOT ignored per AAP §0.6.3.3 — the workspace
# has binary crates and Cargo.lock is committed for reproducible builds.

# Cargo build output — local builds only; never committed
/target/

# Cargo / rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk
**/*.orig

# Editor-generated artifacts (project-agnostic only)
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# IDE-generated artifacts (JetBrains, VS Code, emacs/vim backup files)
# Onboarding hygiene per Checkpoint 1 review INFO finding — keeps the
# workspace clean for contributors who do not set a global gitignore.
.idea/
.vscode/
*~
